{"id":"n56335-1-7","stage":5,"title":"미묘하다 · 微妙","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56335-1-7-1","ko":"이게 잘된 일인지 나쁜 일인지 잘 모르겠어.","zh":"我真不知道这到底是件好事还是坏事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"잘된","meaning":"好，顺利","explanation":"잘되다：好，顺利；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘된","audio":"/audio/7ba43cb1d0d38d1caae0.mp3"}},{"text":"일인지","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일인지","audio":"/audio/30cccb580d72f9fcc309.mp3"}},{"text":"나쁜","meaning":"不良，坏","explanation":"나쁘다：不良，坏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"1","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁜","audio":"/audio/e203b60c1df7f7cc3ba8.mp3"}},{"text":"일인지","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일인지","audio":"/audio/30cccb580d72f9fcc309.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"好，顺利","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"某事情或现象的结果好。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"不良，坏","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f04aa49aa1674bd17e8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56335-1-7-2","ko":"그러게, 상황이 미묘하네.","zh":"是啊，情况真是微妙呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게,","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"상황이","meaning":"状况，情况","explanation":"상황：状况，情况；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상황","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16582","senseId":"1","lemma":"상황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상황이","audio":"/audio/09eb3cbd35313cc9c11c.mp3"}},{"text":"미묘하네.","meaning":"微妙","explanation":"미묘하다：微妙；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"미묘하다","audio":"/audio/de9fe8fb44b48ee1815e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56335","senseId":"1","lemma":"미묘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미묘하네","audio":"/audio/1a5cb4c1318e226bebc1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"946f8147acaaf499","term":"상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"de9fe8fb44b48ee1","term":"미묘하다","zh":"微妙","audio":"/audio/de9fe8fb44b48ee1815e.mp3","entryId":"56335","definition":"不清晰明确，奇怪、新奇到无法言表的程度。","pronunciation":["미묘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/28222945b2e50c3324bd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56335","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，情况真是微妙呢。","我真不知道这到底是件好事还是坏事。","天气真冷。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我真不知道这到底是件好事还是坏事。","天气真冷。","是啊，情况真是微妙呢。"],"answer":2}]}
